<view class="page">
  <!-- 品牌区 -->
  <view class="brand">
    <view class="bead-logo">
      <view class="bead-row">
        <view class="bead bead-1"></view>
        <view class="bead bead-2"></view>
        <view class="bead bead-3"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="bead-row">
        <view class="bead bead-4"></view>
        <view class="bead bead-5"></view>
        <view class="bead bead-6"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="bead-row">
        <view class="bead bead-7"></view>
        <view class="bead bead-8"></view>
        <view class="bead bead-9"></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="brand-title">拼豆图纸生成器</view>
    <view class="brand-sub">任意图片 → 拼豆底稿，一键生成</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 主入口 -->
  <view class="actions">
    <view class="pick-card" bindtap="onPickImage" hover-class="pick-card-hover">
      <view class="pick-plus">＋</view>
      <view class="pick-title">选择图片 / 拍照</view>
      <view class="pick-desc">支持 JPG / PNG / GIF</view>
    </view>

    <view class="pick-card secondary" bindtap="onOpenPalette" hover-class="pick-card-hover">
      <view class="pick-title small">色板设置</view>
      <view class="pick-desc">
        <text wx:if="{{paletteSummary}}">{{paletteSummary}}</text>
        <text wx:else>当前：{{colorSystem}} 全色板</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="tip-card">
      <view class="tip-card-title">选什么图效果好？</view>
      <view class="tip-card-body">
        拼豆是扁平色块的活儿 —— 卡通、logo、像素画这类图出来最干净。
        照片也能转，但颜色会被压扁、细节会丢，尺寸还容易做得很大。
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 继续上次 -->
  <view class="resume" wx:if="{{hasResult}}" bindtap="onResume">
    继续编辑上次的图纸（{{lastGridText}}）
  </view>

  <view class="footer">
    <text>算法开源于 perler-beads，本版为微信小程序移植</text>
  </view>
</view>
